nsfers them to the ubiquitination machinery and promote their degradation (PubMed:18264092, PubMed:18417469, PubMed:19084021, PubMed:19346256, PubMed:21172656, PubMed:24899641). Possible targets include TRPV4 as well as hyperglycosylated HSP90B1 (PubMed:17932042)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}